	/* Hand the sensor I2C bus to the ISP side before the firmware boots:
	 * the firmware drives the sensor itself and its transfers only ACK
	 * when the pins are in the "pin1" (ISP) state.  The AP keeps the
	 * sensor flagged open; on retail board data the state is only
	 * switched by the OFF scenario, which never runs here. */
